  "notes": "The abandonment is not a retry: the settled record is terminal and immutable, so a late completed journal record cannot revive it (asserted in Phase0KillMatrixTests:224-228). The kill-matrix row for the same verb also asserts the acked WAL prefix and the replay/materialized equality, which is where level_1 comes from."
